    tags: ["caseous lymphadenitis", "pseudotuberculosis", "Corynebacterium pseudotuberculosis", "phospholipase D", "onion ring", "pyogranuloma", "thin ewe syndrome", "intracellular", "shearing", "ulcerative lymphangitis", "not acid-fast"]
